OL,3,GNEWSAWildfire-fighting crews 'sent
OL,4,Awithout proper PPE'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews are being sent to tackle
OL,7,Fwildfires without proper protective
OL,8,Fgear, a group that represents rural
OL,9,Fland owners and businesses has claimed.
OL,11,FThe Country Land and Business
OL,12,FAssociation (CLA) said a Freedom of
OL,13,FInformation request (FOI) showed that
OL,14,FRoyal Berkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,15,F(RBFRS) had no specialist wildfire PPE
OL,16,For any drones.
OL,18,FCLA president Gavin Lane said some
OL,19,Ffirefighters were "being sent into
OL,20,Fwildfires in heavy kit made for burning
OL,21,Fbuildings, worn for hours across open
OL,22,Fground in summer heat".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
